    "conditions": "Trigger path: fuzzed IPC stream -> RecordBatchStreamReader -> RecordBatch::ValidateFull() -> internal::ValidateArrayData on nested list/dictionary structures. Input must construct a DictionaryArray (here within list nesting) whose indices array metadata/buffers are inconsistent with actual accessible memory (or dictionary state invalid), so Visit(DictionaryArray) calls CheckBounds on untrusted indices without first validating dictionary existence/buffer integrity. During CheckBounds, BoundsCheckVisitor iterates non-null indices and reads Value(i), leading to out-of-bounds/wild memory read and crash."
